            "notes": "Round 1 still makes us play almost stock OW.  I like to take [Quantum Clip](item_3a108115-ec6e-4b98-8074-1b015cf535f1) just so I keep the muscle memory for it all game.\n\nI have thought about taking [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) right away since it is easy to get breathed on wrong in round 1 and die.  If you find yourself dying a couple times in round 1 consider it, but otherwise just try not to play overly aggressive unless you're really good at Tracer.",
