            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:15:36.942325+00:00",
            "notes": "If you an afford to go into [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) I probably would.  Hopefully you can afford an [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) to go with it otherwise you will only get back 38 armor on abilities since Tracer doesn't get the full 50 on [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) like other classes.\n\nIf you want to keep some of your weapon buffs or you just couldn't get a good round for cash in round 1 you can do [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) and [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) with any thing else you can afford. \n\nThis should help you from falling over as much, but honestly you're not going to solo much.  Play around your team and help clean up.  If the map has a lot of cover consider [Heartbeat Sensor](item_2a4ffaf4-f14b-47d2-a267-0a0e83e87418) to track down people hiding after getting hit by dynamite or torpedo.",
