            "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:15:36.942325+00:00",
            "notes": "Start of round 3 you should easily make it to the combo we use to stay alive.  [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) and [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) make your blinks almost as good as a small health pack.  The 50 armor is over 2 seconds so it's not perfect but the blink itself interrupts most peoples aim for a second.\n\nI recommend [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) so you have over 100 armor.  The reason being is after a blink around cover or something you won't be getting hit but if you were low enough you want that next blink to be able to heal you as well.  If you have the bare minimum armor your buffer is thin and leave you open to be burst down.\n\nWe take [Timelapse](item_20d43db5-d2ad-47e9-b32f-82d8eca006ce) here because we need something for some more damage.  It's not much so it might not be bad to jump to [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c).  Really it is up to you which you would prefer.",
