            "notes": "[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is so good for this build.  At this point in the build you likely see how surviving isn't too bad, but you're probably having trouble doing damage to a tank or [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a).  This item is the fix you are looking for.\n\nThe [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) will help us be able to blink more often for better up time on [Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8).  It also helps itself since we will need the reduction to keep our 3 stacks on [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448).  Once you are in a fight and going through the rhythm of shoot, blink, shoot, blink you should be able to keep it up full time.  \n\n[Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) might be good to help keep yourself topped off, but take whatever you can after this for damage.\n\nIf somehow you are short on cash and need to drop a blue, drop [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and grab an [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) so you can still get the most out of your armor.",
