        {
            "id": "26670ae6-c736-4ab0-9c4e-3551259a081d",
            "build_id": "9dd7208b-1ed7-43ca-ab93-711f23aff885",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:15:36.942325+00:00",
            "notes": "We take [Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) for a cheat death each round.  You might have taken it sooner in which case grab one of the earlier powers now.\n\nRound 5 means you lost at least a round.  The item you get now is a correction to whatever is causing you to lose.  Even if you feel it has not been your fault, there is likely something here you can take to help out.  \n\nIf the other team has a couple people stacking armor because they find you annoying you can do [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).\n\nIf a couple fliers are taking too long to die you might have to take [Aerial Distresser](item_0fcb9020-c729-49b9-b398-3223797b6204) and [Stratosphere Beacon](item_15bf2dc7-5161-47b0-929b-17cbb1d54182).\n\nMaybe you're being focused and you still need more survival and need to take [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) for another cheat death type move.\n\nIf none of that seems to be the case I'd likely go with [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) for a best of both worlds.  Lower your targets [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) and gain some for yourself while always having 10% [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power).  There is also a little bonus armor in there.  You earned it.",
