            "notes": "Same notes as round 5 about picking what you need deal with whatever the issue causing you to drop rounds.\n\nI like to take [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) here because it has some [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) but also a mini cheat death.  It will keep you in more fights (granted you need to duck for cover when this pops.)\n\nIf you find yourself having trouble escaping after [Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) pops you probably want [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) instead and hope you get enough through [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) for some survivability. \n\nIf you have been having no issues with living you can take [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) or if you are rich perhaps [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) to just finish people off easier.",
