            "notes": "[Bullet Time](item_6840382c-ae92-491a-b70c-b49f3a76003a) will save us from a lot of damage after a recall.\n\nAt this point you likely want [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) just to kill faster.  If you already have it over something else than you can go with [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce).\n\nI don't like to drop [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) but this late in the game that 25 overhealth might not cut it anymore.  If you don't want to lose the [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction) you can pick up [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f).\n\n[Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) is also an option but the healing form it is pretty weak, but still some healing is better than no healing.\n\n[Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) can also be really good at this point.  We are not stacking ability power so some heroes at this point are surviving pulse bomb.  Also, if you're like me going in to stick a bomb often causes more problems than it helps.  This would probably be my go to option unless [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a) is in your game in which case I always like to stick a bomb to her.",
